<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS1" title="In Appendix A Detailed background on the path-star task ‣ Deep sequence models tend to memorize geometrically; it is unclear why." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.1 </span>Failure of next-token learning in the in-context path-star task</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Deep sequence models tend to memorize geometrically; it is unclear why." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Experimental setup</span></a>
